  "2026-07-26T19:42:51.095Z","harness:codex","Evidence: completed a derived SDK aggregate census over all supported contracts, governance, query, and runtime exports. The aggregate now exposes every supported non-test symbol; the only exclusion is the documented private test hook. Snapshot schema v2 fails closed on missing aggregate symbols and packed consumer proof resolved 954 aggregate exports with zero missing symbols. Linked test passed; full repository coverage passed 6,425 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; lint/static gates are green."
